  Mark unavailable cost/metrics unknown; do not fabricate benchmark numbers.
- Reproduce installation, CLI runs and relevant checks from a clean submitted
  checkout. Update README/setup and failure/mode guidance from executed behavior.
  Preserve concurrent work; inspect the current optional-notebook, lint and format
  state before carrying forward old failures as still current.
- Prepare slides, an accurate sponsor contribution explanation and a 1–4 minute
