  mock sources. A dashboard and extra agent roles are outside the MVP priority.
- Check artifacts for secrets, sensitive exports, private endpoints and raw
  provider bodies. Confirm actual portal requirements/deadline with the team;
  local notes record target freeze Oct 26 and submission before Oct 27, 2026
  23:45 UTC, subject to portal verification. External publication/submission must
  follow the user's authorization; do not invent a submission confirmation.

Done when:
- The release checklist in `docs/EXECUTION_PLAN.md` has executed evidence for
  genuine integrations, scenario/evaluation results, approved model, clean setup
  and ready assets. Every unresolved access/coverage/submission gate stays explicit.
- A new reviewer can reproduce the submitted CLI and distinguish current evidence,
